          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of the movement of a luminous phenomenon in the sky: observation of a bolide, result of the atmospheric reentry of a meteoroid, probably from the Eta-Aquariid shower.",
